      "content": "hey, i've been doing some deep dives into the standard 440Hz tuning used in the power grid and audio tech. there's a lot of info suggesting this specific frequency was mandated to disrupt natural bio-resonance and keep people in a state of low-level lethargy. can you look into the history of frequency modulation standards and see if there's any evidence that they've been calibrated specifically for social control or behavioral suppression?",
